{"type":"message","id":"e94f6db7","parentId":"90c237a0","timestamp":"2026-05-17T06:48:07.797Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The error 1101 is a 500 Internal Server Error. The /send endpoint exists but is returning an error. Let me try with a simpler message and see if there's an issue with the message format. Let me also check if there's another way to send messages.\n\nWait, could it be a worker memory issue? Or maybe the API path is different - like `/api/send` or `/message`? Or maybe the message format is wrong - perhaps I need to send `message` instead of `content`?\n\nLet me try other variations.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n`/send` 端点存在但返回 500 错误。可能是参数格式问题，让我尝试其他变体：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-17986d1c-f6c8-4271-9c98-f54ca04c6ba7","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"thread\":\"arbitration\",\"text\":\"heartbeat test\"}' -w \"\\nHTTP_CODE:%{http_code}\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-7124e4c2-9915-42e5-b44c-b7db68c0cce0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/message\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"heartbeat test\"}' -w \"\\nHTTP_CODE:%{http_code}\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":224,"output":338,"cacheRead":20304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20866,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779000467168,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f945d48c-7aa3-449e-88f9-e580e3a0068a"}}
