{"type":"message","id":"ac37ed8b","parentId":"3239ad25","timestamp":"2026-05-17T06:48:19.234Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-59033b2c-2027-4e2b-998d-484f73a8e6c0","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{ [230 bytes data]\n* TLSv1.3 (IN), TLS handshake, Newsession Ticket (4):\n{ [230 bytes data]\n* old SSL session ID is stale, removing\n{ [5 bytes data]\n< HTTP/2 500 \r\n< date: Sun, 17 May 2026 06:48:19 GMT\r\n< content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\r\n< content-length: 16\r\n< cache-control: private, max-age=0, no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate, post-check=0, pre-check=0\r\n< expires: Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:01 GMT\r\n< referrer-policy: same-origin\r\n< x-frame-options: SAMEORIGIN\r\n< server: cloudflare\r\n< cf-ray: 9fd0acffea92e388-NRT\r\n< alt-svc: h3=\":443\"; ma=86400\r\n< \r\n{ [5 bytes data]\n* Connection #0 to host echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev left intact\nerror code: 1101"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":170,"aggregated":"{ [230 bytes data]\n* TLSv1.3 (IN), TLS handshake, Newsession Ticket (4):\n{ [230 bytes data]\n* old SSL session ID is stale, removing\n{ [5 bytes data]\n< HTTP/2 500 \r\n< date: Sun, 17 May 2026 06:48:19 GMT\r\n< content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\r\n< content-length: 16\r\n< cache-control: private, max-age=0, no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate, post-check=0, pre-check=0\r\n< expires: Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:01 GMT\r\n< referrer-policy: same-origin\r\n< x-frame-options: SAMEORIGIN\r\n< server: cloudflare\r\n< cf-ray: 9fd0acffea92e388-NRT\r\n< alt-svc: h3=\":443\"; ma=86400\r\n< \r\n{ [5 bytes data]\n* Connection #0 to host echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev left intact\nerror code: 1101","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779000499234}}
{"type":"message","id":"b1c191c3","parentId":"ac37ed8b","timestamp":"2026-05-17T06:48:32.262Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The error is coming from Cloudflare Workers (the platform itself is returning a 500 with error code 1101). This is a Cloudflare Workers specific error that typically means the Worker has exceeded some limit (memory, CPU, etc.) or there's an internal error.\n\nLet me check if maybe the message is being sent but the response is wrong, by querying the history endpoint again. Or maybe the `/send` endpoint doesn't exist and only `/message` does.\n\nActually, wait - looking at the first curl commands for GET /history, those worked fine. The problem is the POST /send endpoint. This could be a Cloudflare Workers limit being hit (error 1101 is \"Worker out of resource\" or similar in some contexts), or the endpoint is broken.\n\n\nLet me try querying the history to see if any messages were actually persisted despite the error response.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-8fab460b-b404-4ba9-955f-39c07ae29600","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}' 2>&1\n\necho \"---\"\n\n# Check if message was sent by getting history\ncurl -s -X GET \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=2\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" | python3 -c \"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print('Latest:', d['messages'][0]['id'], '|', d['messages'][0]['content'][:80])\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21453,"output":379,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21944,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead