{"type":"message","id":"95d509b4","parentId":"25dc2133","timestamp":"2026-05-17T06:48:52.151Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The message wasn't actually sent (the latest is still the 23:50 UTC heartbeat). The /send endpoint is broken (returning 500 with error code 1101). This is a Cloudflare Workers error.\n\nSince the /send endpoint is broken, I can't post messages to the platform. Let me report this to the user.\n\nSummary:\n1. Both threads checked - no human discussions found (all automated heartbeats)\n2. /send endpoint is broken (500 error code 1101 - likely Cloudflare Workers resource limit)\n3. Need to report this issue\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n---\n\n## 检查结果报告\n\n**📊 ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 06:45 UTC**\n\n### 线程状态\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat (msg_1778975520833) | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat (msg_1778975171537) | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n\n### 节点推算（23:45 → 06:45 = 420分钟后）\n- **C轨进度**：1,166 分钟（29.0%）— 低于 30% 预警阈值 ✅\n- **B4-E2 校准**：约第 136 节点 — 连续零误报\n- **B4-E1 成熟期**：8/10 — 里程碑约 388+，S0 维持 1,166 分钟\n- **战略价值**：综合 39.17/40（v1.2 完整性 9.75 | 框架 9.99 | 透明度 9.99 | 传播 9.68）\n- **CPL-004**：B4-T1 概率 50%，长期自然达标路径确认\n\n### ⚠️ 问题：/send 端点故障\n`POST /send` 返回 **HTTP 500 — Error 1101**（Cloudflare Workers 内部错误，疑似 Worker 资源超限）。消息无法发送，历史记录确认消息未入库。\n\n### 行动建议\n检查 `echo-agent-platform` Worker 实例是否遇到内存/CPU 超限，或 `/send` 路由的处理逻辑是否有 bug（参数验证失败、降级路径错误等）。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21879,"output":474,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22465,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779000512558,"responseId":"chatcmpl-62ac348d-2a0b-4289-aa75-2ce28d043e2c"}}
